        "segments": [
          {
            "id": "s1_1",
            "speaker": "ANDREW",
            "text": "Good morning, Clare House Hotel. Andrew speaking. I'm the (Example) Events Manager.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s1_2",
            "speaker": "SAM",
            "text": "Good morning, Andrew. My name's Samantha. I'm arranging a party for my parents' fiftieth wedding anniversary, and I'm ringing to ask about hiring a room some time next September. Also my parents and several of the guests will need accommodation.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s1_3",
            "speaker": "ANDREW",
            "text": "OK, I'm sure we can help you with that. Will you be having a sit-down meal or a buffet?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s1_4",
            "speaker": "SAM",
            "text": "Probably a sit-down.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s1_5",
            "speaker": "ANDREW",
            "text": "And do you know how many people there'll be?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s1_6",
            "speaker": "SAM",
            "text": "Around eighty, I think.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s1_7",
            "speaker": "ANDREW",
            "text": "Well we have two rooms that can hold that number. One is the Adelphi Room. That can seat eighty-five, or hold over a hundred if people are standing for a buffet.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          }
        ],
