        "segments": [
          {
            "id": "s2_1",
            "speaker": "SAM",
            "text": "Right.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s2_2",
            "speaker": "ANDREW",
            "text": "If you have live music, there's room for four or five musicians in the gallery overlooking the room. Our guests usually appreciate the fact that the music can be loud enough for dancing, but not too loud for conversation.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s2_3",
            "speaker": "SAM",
            "text": "Yes, I really don't like it when you can't talk.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s2_4",
            "speaker": "ANDREW",
            "text": "Exactly. Now the Adelphi Room is at the back of the hotel, and there are French windows leading out onto the terrace. This has a beautiful display of pots of roses at that time of the year.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s2_5",
            "speaker": "SAM",
            "text": "Which direction does it face?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s2_6",
            "speaker": "ANDREW",
            "text": "Southwest, so that side of the hotel gets the sun in the afternoon and early evening.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s2_7",
            "speaker": "SAM",
            "text": "Very nice.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s2_8",
            "speaker": "ANDREW",
            "text": "From the terrace you can see the area of trees within the grounds of the hotel, or you can stroll through there to the river - that's on the far side, so it isn't visible from the hotel.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          }
        ],
