        "segments": [
          {
            "id": "s3_1",
            "speaker": "SAM",
            "text": "OK.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_2",
            "speaker": "ANDREW",
            "text": "Then another option is the Carlton Room. This is a bit bigger - it can hold up to a hundred and ten people - and it has the advantage of a stage, which is useful if you have any entertainment, or indeed a small band can fit onto it.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_3",
            "speaker": "SAM",
            "text": "And can you go outside from the room?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_4",
            "speaker": "ANDREW",
            "text": "No, the Carlton Room is on the first floor, but on one side the windows look out onto the lake.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_5",
            "speaker": "SAM",
            "text": "Lovely. I think either of those rooms would be suitable.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_6",
            "speaker": "ANDREW",
            "text": "Can I tell you about some of the options we offer in addition?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_7",
            "speaker": "SAM",
            "text": "Please do.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_8",
            "speaker": "ANDREW",
            "text": "As well as a meal, you can have an MC, a Master of Ceremonies, who'll be with you throughout the party.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          }
        ],
